### 3. Get mentor by ID

GET {{host}}/api/Mentors/{{mentorId}}
Accept: application/json

### Pagination test
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json
### 4. Update mentor

PUT {{host}}/api/Mentors/{{mentorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Monika Hossain Updated",
  "emailAddress": "monikahossain25@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "01951337905",
  "hourlyRate": 1800
}
### Search by name
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?search=Karim

### Search by email
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?search=example.com

### Search by phone
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?search=017



### Sort by hourly rate — Ascending
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?sortBy=hourlyRate&sortDirection=asc

### Sort by hourly rate — Descending
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?sortBy=hourlyRate&sortDirection=desc

### Invalid sorting field
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?sortBy=invalidField

### Invalid page number
GET {{host}}/api/Mentors?pageNumber=0

### Unknown endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/unknown-endpoint

### 5. Delete mentor

DELETE {{host}}/api/Mentors/{{mentorId}}


### 6. Check deleted mentor

GET {{host}}/api/Mentors/{{mentorId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Test global 404 Problem Details

GET {{host}}/api/unknown-endpoint
Accept: application/problem+json

### Validation test - invalid mentor

POST {{host}}/api/Mentors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "emailAddress": "not-an-email",
  "phoneNumber": "abc",
  "hourlyRate": 0
}
